    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n99787" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνδοξάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>join in approving</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμοι συνδεδοξασμένοι ὑπὸ πάντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1310a15
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>agree with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ σώματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					1.2.3
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				3.1.123
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Marin.
				<u>Procl.</u>
				21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>glorify</i> or <i>extol jointly</i>, in 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
				8.17
			</span></i>.</div>
